1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,870
Episode 24: Seven Nights in the Sealed Chamber

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:08,759
Reaching the deepest cul-de-sac of
the Dragon Grotto, the companions

3
00:00:08,859 --> 00:00:11,840
stood before a colossal adamantine
portal carved into the living rock face.

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,723
Towering scores of fathoms into the gloom, the
gate was intricately inscribed with the sacred

5
00:00:14,823 --> 00:00:17,810
litanies of the Holy Order, the swirling glyphs of
the wind, and the roaring sigils of the White Flame.

6
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,816
At the portal's center rested three circular indentations
radiating celestial starlight, verdant jade,

7
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:23,780
and pure sanctified fire, denoting an ancient elemental
seal that no physical crowbar could ever breach.

8
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:29,750
Cilia rested her staff against the door,
sensing the intricate mana conduits.

9
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:35,720
[Celia] "This is the Tripartite
Seal of the Sworn Brothers.

10
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,369
[Kadan] It yields only when the pure faith of the
Holy Knights, the noble royal lineage of the winds,

11
00:00:38,469 --> 00:00:41,690
and the sanctified flame of redemption resonate in absolute harmony.
Our mana frequencies must synchronize to the exact heartbeat."

12
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:44,299
[Ignis] Unslinging his iron shield, Kadan
stepped before the starlight socket.

13
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:47,660
"The covenant forged between Master Aleksandar, Uncle
Balian, and Queen Sylphid lives on in this stone."

14
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:53,630
Ignis stepped before the flame
socket, his head held high.

15
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:59,600
"With the fire of an unyielding spirit
seeking true atonement, I offer my strength."

16
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,966
[Kadan] Exchanging
glances of profound trust,

17
00:01:02,066 --> 00:01:05,570
the three youths pressed their palms
into the three respective sockets.

18
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:11,540
[Kadan] "Now!"

19
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:17,510
At Kadan's command, a
torrent of mana surged forth.

20
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:20,486
From Kadan's fingertips flowed pristine starlight
honed across northern tundras; from Cilia's palms

21
00:01:20,586 --> 00:01:23,480
poured life-giving gale mana; and from Ignis's grasp
roared molten white fire that purged all impurity.

22
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:29,450
The three elemental streams raced along the
carved circuitry in dazzling brilliance.

23
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:35,420
Cra-aaack!

24
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:38,038
Centuries of slumber ended as titanic

25
00:01:38,138 --> 00:01:41,390
adamantine gears groaned
in thunderous synchrony.

26
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:45,022
The massive gates parted, unleashing a cascade
of ancient temple frankincense and pure,

27
00:01:45,122 --> 00:01:47,360
revitalizing mana that filled
the grotto like a waterfall.

28
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:53,330
Within lay a magnificent vaulted
sanctuary of white marble.

29
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:56,267
[Celia] Enshrined atop the central altar was
an imposing defensive relic carved from the

30
00:01:56,367 --> 00:01:59,300
fossilized jaw of an ancient wyrm: the legendary
Dragon Breaker shield reinforcement armature.

31
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,962
Flanking the relic rested Paladin Balian's

32
00:02:02,062 --> 00:02:05,270
sanctified breastplate and
Master Gawain's wind cloak.

33
00:02:05,470 --> 00:02:08,117
With reverent steps, Kadan approached
the altar, lifting the Dragon

34
00:02:08,217 --> 00:02:11,240
Breaker armature and affixing it onto
the face of his unadorned iron shield.

35
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:17,210
Clang!

36
00:02:17,410 --> 00:02:20,309
As if forged together at the dawn of
time, the dragonbone armature fused

37
00:02:20,409 --> 00:02:23,180
seamlessly with the iron rim, erupting
in blinding golden brilliance.

38
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:26,215
Raised relief of dragon scales and the
holy cross blossomed across the face,

39
00:02:26,315 --> 00:02:29,150
multiplying the shield's kinetic deflection
and mana capacity a hundredfold.

40
00:02:29,350 --> 00:02:32,082
[Ignis] A profound pulse of celestial mana

41
00:02:32,182 --> 00:02:35,120
coursed through Kadan's
arms into his spirit.

42
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:41,090
Ignis breathed in awe.

43
00:02:41,290 --> 00:02:47,060
[Celia] "Magnificent...

44
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:50,249
Master Aleksandar's shield has
reclaimed its legendary glory.

45
00:02:50,349 --> 00:02:53,030
No siege cannon in the empire
can breach that bulwark."

46
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:56,248
Smiling, Cilia retrieved a
pair of ancient gale-rune

47
00:02:56,348 --> 00:02:59,000
earrings that amplified
atmospheric resonance.

48
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:04,970
[Ignis] "The final armaments prepared
by our parents are assembled."

49
00:03:05,170 --> 00:03:08,144
Suddenly, the heavy
stomp of iron greaves and

50
00:03:08,244 --> 00:03:10,940
violent battle cries shattered the peace.

51
00:03:11,140 --> 00:03:14,250
Thirty elite shock troopers of Lucian's
'Iron Hounds' burst into the chamber,

52
00:03:14,350 --> 00:03:16,910
led by Commander Barto wielding
an immense two-handed warhammer.

53
00:03:17,110 --> 00:03:22,880
Barto sneered in feral delight.

54
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:26,254
[Barto] "The northern rats
unearthed the vault for us!

55
00:03:26,354 --> 00:03:28,850
Surrender the relics and offer your necks!"

56
00:03:29,050 --> 00:03:31,832
Leaping into the air, Barto
brought his crushing hammer

57
00:03:31,932 --> 00:03:34,820
down toward Kadan's skull with
world-shattering momentum.

58
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:37,911
Kadan stood immovable, raising
the newly forged Dragon

59
00:03:38,011 --> 00:03:40,790
Breaker shield to meet the
blow with star-breathing.

60
00:03:40,990 --> 00:03:46,760
Boom!

61
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,981
The moment hammer struck shield,

62
00:03:49,081 --> 00:03:52,730
a golden kinetic shockwave
detonated across the chamber.

63
00:03:52,930 --> 00:03:55,254
Barto's iron hammer shattered
into a thousand jagged fragments,

64
00:03:55,354 --> 00:03:58,700
and the concussive backlash hurled the commander
against the basalt wall, vomiting blood.

65
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:02,180
[Ignis] Caught in the radial shockwave, the thirty shock
troopers were swept off their feet like dry leaves.

66
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,670
Ignis and Cilia swept forward, neutralizing
the disoriented vanguard in seconds.

67
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:06,779
In a single decisive exchange,

68
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:10,640
the empire's elite heavy
infantry was utterly dismantled.

69
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,168
Leaving the broken weapons in their wake,
the companions inspected the rear portal.

70
00:04:13,268 --> 00:04:16,610
Beyond lay a forgotten aqueduct leading directly into the
vaults beneath the grand cathedral of the imperial capital.

71
00:04:16,810 --> 00:04:22,580
Clasping his reinforced shield,
Kadan spoke with immovable resolve.

72
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:24,890
[Kadan] "Our preparations are complete.

73
00:04:24,990 --> 00:04:28,550
Through these waterways, we march
into the heart of the empire."

74
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:34,520
Cilia gripped her staff with quiet fury.

75
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,474
[Celia] "In the cathedral
above, Lucian is preparing a

76
00:04:37,574 --> 00:04:40,490
coerced wedding to consolidate
his tyrannical usurpation.

77
00:04:40,690 --> 00:04:46,460
[Ignis] We shall expose his treachery
before the eyes of the entire realm."

78
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:52,430
Ignis clenched his fists, holy
fire burning in his gaze.

79
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:58,400
"I will personally dismantle
the empire's hypocrisy.

80
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,340
[Celia] Forward, my brothers!" Adorned in ancestral
relics and bound by sacred oaths, the three companions

81
00:05:01,440 --> 00:05:04,370
charged into the subterranean waterway, sounding the
overture that would tear open the continent's darkest night.

